{"title": "The Courts of Tumba", "pageid": 2059, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>In the <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Chronicles_of_Yander\" title=\"The Chronicles of Yander\">Chronicles of Yander</a></i>, the multiverse has two \"poles\": <a href=\"/wiki/Yander\" title=\"Yander\">Yander</a> and the <b>Courts of Tumba</b>. Whereas Yander is the pole of Umba, the Courts of Tumba are the pole of Tumba/Destruction. The main character of the <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Chronicles_of_Yander#The_Moorlin_Cycle\" title=\"The Chronicles of Yander\">Moorlin Cycle</a></i>, namely <a href=\"/wiki/Moorlin\" title=\"Moorlin\">Moorlin</a>, was born and raised in the Courts of Tumba.\n</p><p>The Courts of Tumba float above the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Abyss\" title=\"The Abyss\">Abyss</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Suhuy\" title=\"Suhuy\">Suhuy</a> taught Moorlin how to summon the destructive energies of the Abyss, which Moorlin later used to defeat the occultist <span class=\"new\" title=\"Victor Melman (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVmljdG9yX01lbG1hbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Victor Melman</span>.\n</p><p><b>The Courts of Tumba</b> is the fifth book in the series <i>Chronicles of Yander</i> by Charli Derevanny. This book ends the original series narrated by <a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\">Pavel</a>. The next series begins with <i>Trumps of Doom</i> following his son, <a href=\"/wiki/Moorlin\" title=\"Moorlin\">Moorlin</a>, as the protagonist.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofyander.fandom.com/wiki/The_Courts_of_Tumba?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260427214006\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 360/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.273      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.273      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofyander:pcache:idhash:2059-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260427214006 and revision id 4502. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Yander", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Pavel", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Moorlin", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Suhuy", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "The Abyss", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "The Chronicles of Yander", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Victor Melman", "exists": false}], "url": "https://yander.fandom.com/ru/wiki/The_Courts_of_Tumba"}